            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          }
        ],
        "content": {
          "attachments": {
            "fig-gradient-vs-damage.png": {
              "image/png": ""
            }
          },
          "contentMode": "map",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**The first map said the steep reach was where this would be violent. It was.**\n\n**15 of 16** bridges went in the\ngorge, **22 of 47** in the middle\nvalley, **6 of 108** on the open\nvalley.\n\n![Bed gradient and bridge losses over the same three reaches](attachment:fig-gradient-vs-damage.png)\n\n**On the map:** bridges, dark red where destroyed\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "The flood outline against the three reaches"
        }
      }
    },
    "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8001-000000000004": {
      "name": "Who lived near the river, and where buildings were lost",
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 9.0,
        "extent": [
          9306412.705333773,
