          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**The first map refused to divide 19 reported destroyed by 115 mapped. That\nrefusal still stands.**\n\nInside the extent there are\n**171** bridges\nand\n**43**\ndestroyed. HOT's separate assessment looked at 59 and called 39 washed out.\n\nTwo counts, not one. Neither can be held against the reported 19, which still\ncarries no stretch of river.\n\n**On the map:** every bridge, dark red where destroyed\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "The bridges, and whether the numbers can be compared yet"
        }
      }
    },
    "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8001-000000000007": {
      "name": "Three agencies, three words for the cause",
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 11.6,
        "extent": [
          9491043.942980107,
          3264505.668343575,
          9547928.567593724,
          3306412.6923275436
        ],
        "transition": {
          "type": "linear",
          "time": 2.4
        },
        "layerOverride": [
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
