            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-00000000000d",
            "visible": true,
            "opacity": 1.0
          }
        ],
        "content": {
          "attachments": {},
          "contentMode": "map",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**The flood left something behind, and it is still there.**\n\nUNOSAT detected **two barrier lakes** on imagery of 28 August,\n**20 ha** and\n**12 ha**, where debris dammed the channel. They\nsit above a valley that has just lost most of its bridges.\n\nPreliminary, and not validated in the field.\n\n**On the map:** the teal shapes are the two lakes\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "Two new lakes above the valley"
        }
      }
    },
